# Normalise to LF in the repository. Contributors work on Windows, macOS, and Linux, and a
# mixed-ending diff is noise nobody should have to read.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ifc text eol=lf
*.obj text eol=lf

# Keep generated lockfiles out of diff review noise, but still tracked.
Cargo.lock linguist-generated=true
